<section id="courses" class="courses-intro-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <h1 class="display-3--title--big fw-bold">About The Author</h1>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-start">
                <div class="heading-line text-left"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-3">
                <h2>Meet Abhishek Joshi</h2>
                <div class="mt-3 text-muted">
                    <p class="text-muted">Abhishek has an impressive and diverse range of experiences in the software development field, from software engineer to VP of engineering roles. His expertise in Docker and Kubernetes is particularly valuable in today's rapidly evolving tech landscape.</p>
                    <p class="text-muted">His extensive background in enterprise product development, performance optimization, and SOA architecture design showcases a deep understanding of complex systems. Also, his familiarity with agile methodologies, distributed systems, and scalability is also highly relevant in today's software industry.</p>
                    <p class="text-muted">Abhishek has been dedicated to imparting valuable technical training to numerous multinational engineering teams. His expertise lies in Docker and Kubernetes, making him a sought-after authority in the field. His commitment to nurturing talent and enhancing technical capabilities has made him a respected figure in the industry.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-3 text-center">
                <div class="services__pic">
                    <img src="/images/AbhishekJoshi.png?1=1" alt="marketing illustration" class="img-fluid">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-3">
                <h3>Some of his core technical competence</h3>
                <div class="mt-3 text-muted">
                    <p class="my-2"><span class="fas fa-arrow-right text-secondary">&nbsp;</span><span class="mx-2">15+ Years in Product Development</span></p>
                    <p class="my-2"><span class="fas fa-arrow-right text-secondary">&nbsp;</span><span class="mx-2">Docker &amp; Kubernetes</span></p>
                    <p class="my-2"><span class="fas fa-arrow-right text-secondary">&nbsp;</span><span class="mx-2">Microsoft Azure & AWS Cloud Platform</span></p>
                    <p class="my-2"><span class="fas fa-arrow-right text-secondary">&nbsp;</span><span class="mx-2">Microservices and Design Patterns</span></p>
                    <p class="my-2"><span class="fas fa-arrow-right text-secondary">&nbsp;</span><span class="mx-2">Distributed and Serverless Architecture</span></p>
                    <p class="my-2"><span class="fas fa-arrow-right text-secondary">&nbsp;</span><span class="mx-2">Apache Kafka and IoT</span></p>
                    <p class="my-2"><span class="fas fa-arrow-right text-secondary">&nbsp;</span><span class="mx-2">Multi-threading and Socket Programming</span></p>
                    <p class="my-2"><span class="fas fa-arrow-right text-secondary">&nbsp;</span><span class="mx-2">.NET Core, C#, and Python</span></p>
                    <p class="my-2"><span class="fas fa-arrow-right text-secondary">&nbsp;</span><span class="mx-2">Web Socket and Windows Services</span></p>
                    <p class="my-2"><span class="fas fa-arrow-right text-secondary">&nbsp;</span><span class="mx-2">Agile, TDD, Git, and DevOps</span></p>
